<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93796" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σημαν-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>significant</i>, opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσημος, ὄνομά ἐστι φωνὴ ς. κατὰ
					συνθήκην ἄνευ χρόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Int.</u>
					16a19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῆμα . . φωνὴ συνθετὴ ς. μετὰ χρόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Po.</u>
					1457a14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος . . ἐστι φωνὴ ς. κατὰ συνθήκην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Int.</u>
					16b26
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.48
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ὑγιείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Top.</u>
					106b36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πάσης κακίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ὄρη</span> mountains
				<i>giving signs</i> of the weather, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				51
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. παρωτίδων</span>
			<i>indicative</i> of mumps, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(1).405
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κά</span>
			<i>significant symptoms</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Praec.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Top.</u>
					106b37
				</span></i>
			: c.gen., <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				10.7
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					31.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
